# being invisible to git, so a clone would have had none of them.
# suites' phase libraries, and this one was worse than uncommittable: dereg_simulation.sh (the whole
# deregistration half of the dual-mechanism phase) and preflight.sh (all of phase 1) existed only on
# the box that wrote them, so a clone would have run a ladder with two stages silently absent. The
# is still ignored.
