# The swap proxy keeps its own encrypted password store by the same mechanism (see
# swap_wallet_manager.py). It was not listed here, so an operator running the swap rail would have
# had wallet passwords sitting committable in the worktree. Found 2026-08-24 by the file this
# session's own tests left behind.

# Query-path fan-out runtime toggles (see query.py:_query_fanout_enabled)
.query_threaded
.query_fanout
# Kappa fingerprint-cache runtime toggles (see kappa.py:_kappa_cache_enabled)
.kappa_nocache
.kappa_cache
